msgstr "Astellung Beliichtung 1"

#: src/onboarding.py:644
msgid "Setup lighting 2"
msgstr "Astellung Beliichtung 2"

#: src/onboarding.py:662
msgid "Can't save face model"
msgstr "Kann net Gesiicht Modell retten"

#: src/onboarding.py:667 src/onboarding.py:714
msgid "Scan second model"
msgstr "Zweet Modell scannen"

#: src/onboarding.py:673
msgid "Couldn't record the second model"
msgstr "Dat zweet Modell konnt net opgeholl ginn"

#: src/onboarding.py:674
msgid ""
"Your first model is saved, so face login already works. The room must still "
"be bright enough to see your face — change the light rather than turning it "
"off — then try again, or skip and add a model later from Settings."
msgstr ""
"Ären éischte Modell gëtt gespäichert, sou datt Face Login scho "
"funktionnéiert. De Raum muss nach hell genuch sinn fir Äert Gesiicht ze "
"gesinn - ännert d'Liicht anstatt se auszeschalten - da probéiert et nach eng "
"Kéier, oder spréngt a füügt e Modell méi spéit aus Astellungen derbäi."

#: src/onboarding.py:708
msgid "Second scan: different lighting"
msgstr "Zweete Scan: verschidde Beliichtung"

#: src/onboarding.py:710
msgid ""
"First model saved. Now change the light — for example turn a lamp on or off, "
"move away from the window, or use the other room light — keep your face "
"clearly visible, then press Scan again."
msgstr ""
"Éischte Modell gespäichert. Elo ännert d'Luucht - zum Beispill schalt eng "
"Lampe un oder aus, réckelt ewech vun der Fënster, oder benotzt déi aner "
"Raumliicht - haalt Äert Gesiicht kloer sichtbar, dréckt dann nach eng Kéier "
"op Scan."

#: src/onboarding.py:752
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> Checking TPM hardware and tools..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello kann Ären {} automatesch opmaachen mat "
"Gesiichtsauthentifikatioun (detektéiert Portemonnaie: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM Hardware an Tools kontrolléieren ..."

#: src/onboarding.py:772
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected. Installing <i>tpm2-tools</i> "
"automatically..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello kann Ären {} automatesch opmaachen mat "
"Gesiichtsauthentifikatioun (detektéiert Portemonnaie: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM Hardware entdeckt. Installéiert <i>tpm2-tools</i> "
"automatesch ..."

#: src/onboarding.py:784
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> Hardware TPM 2.0 active. Your password will be securely "
"sealed inside the TPM."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello kann Ären {} automatesch opmaachen mat "
"Gesiichtsauthentifikatioun (detektéiert Portemonnaie: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> Hardware TPM 2.0 aktiv. Äert Passwuert gëtt sécher am TPM "
"versiegelt."

#: src/onboarding.py:786
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected, but automatic installation of "
"<i>tpm2-tools</i> failed. Run <code>sudo apt install tpm2-tools</code>. "
"Falling back to software-based credential caching."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello kann Ären {} automatesch opmaachen mat "
"Gesiichtsauthentifikatioun (detektéiert Portemonnaie: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM Hardware entdeckt, awer automatesch Installatioun vun "
"<i>tpm2-tools</i> ass gescheitert. Run <code>sudo apt install tpm2-tools</"
"code>. Falen zréck op Software-baséiert Umeldungscaching."

#: src/onboarding.py:788
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> No TPM hardware detected. Using software-based credential "
"caching (AES-256-GCM)."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello kann Ären {} automatesch opmaachen mat "
"Gesiichtsauthentifikatioun (detektéiert Portemonnaie: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> Keng TPM Hardware fonnt. Benotzt Software-baséiert "
"Umeldungscaching (AES-256-GCM)."

