#: src/onboarding.ui:9 src/onboarding.ui:14
msgid "Welcome to Ubuntu Hello"
msgstr "Wëllkomm op Ubuntu Hello"

#: src/onboarding.ui:51
msgid "Setup is done!"
msgstr "Setup ass gemaach!"

#: src/onboarding.ui:67
msgid ""
"We're done! Ubuntu Hello is now active on this computer. Try doing anything "
"you would normally have to type your password for to authenticate, like "
"running a command with sudo. If you enabled keyring auto-unlock, your login "
"keyring or KWallet will also be unlocked automatically on login.\n"
"\n"
"You can open the Ubuntu Hello Configurator later on to change more advanced "
"settings or add additional models. Press Finish below to close this window "
"and open the Ubuntu Hello Configurator. "
msgstr ""
"Mir si fäerdeg! Ubuntu Hello ass elo op dësem Computer aktiv. Probéiert "
"alles ze maachen, fir datt Dir normalerweis Äert Passwuert aginn fir ze "
"authentifizéieren, wéi e Kommando mat sudo ze lafen. Wann Dir d'Auto-Spär "
"vun der Schlësselring aktivéiert hutt, gëtt Äre Login-Schlësselring oder "
"KWallet och automatesch beim Login opgehuewen.\n"
"\n"
"Dir kënnt den Ubuntu Hello Configurator spéider opmaachen fir méi "
"fortgeschratt Astellungen z'änneren oder zousätzlech Modeller derbäizefügen. "
"Press Finish ënnendrënner fir dës Fënster zouzemaachen an den Ubuntu Hello "
"Configurator opzemaachen."

#: src/onboarding.ui:103
msgid "Setting a certainty policy"
msgstr "Eng Sécherheetspolitik setzen"

#: src/onboarding.ui:119
msgid ""
"Because of changes in angles, distance, and other factors a face match is "
"never exactly the same as the stored face model. On this page you can set "
"how strict Ubuntu Hello should be."
msgstr ""
"Wéinst Ännerungen am Winkel, Distanz an aner Faktoren ass e Gesiichtsmatch "
"ni genau d'selwecht wéi de gespäichert Gesiichtsmodell. Op dëser Säit kënnt "
"Dir astellen wéi strikt Ubuntu Hello soll sinn."

#: src/onboarding.ui:149
msgid "Fast"
msgstr "Schnell"

#: src/onboarding.ui:158
msgid ""
"Allows more fuzzy matches, \n"
"but speeds up the scanning process greatly."
msgstr ""
"Erlaabt méi fuzzy Matcher, \n"
"mä beschleunegt de Scannen Prozess immens."

#: src/onboarding.ui:181
msgid "Balanced"
msgstr "Equilibréiert"

#: src/onboarding.ui:190
msgid ""
"Still relatively quick detection, \n"
"but might not log you in when further away."
msgstr ""
"Nach relativ séier Detektioun, \n"
"awer aloggen Iech vläicht net wann Dir méi wäit ewech ass."

#: src/onboarding.ui:212
msgid "Secure"
msgstr "Séchert"

#: src/onboarding.ui:222
msgid ""
"The slightly safer option, \n"
"but will take much longer to authenticate you"
msgstr ""
"Déi liicht méi sécher Optioun, \n"
"awer dauert vill méi laang fir Iech z'authentifizéieren"

#: src/onboarding.ui:332
msgid "Skip for now"
msgstr "Elo mol iwwersprangen"

#: src/onboarding.ui:337
msgid ""
"You can add more face models later from Settings or with: sudo ubuntu-hello "
"add"
msgstr ""
"Dir kënnt spéider an den Astellungen oder mat „sudo ubuntu-hello add“ weider "
"Gesiichtsmodeller dobäisetzen"

#: src/onboarding.ui:355 src/onboarding.ui:482
msgid "Configuring webcam"
msgstr "Webcam konfiguréieren"

#: src/onboarding.ui:387
msgid "Is the infrared emitter flashing ?"
msgstr "Blénkt den Infrarout-Emitter?"

#: src/onboarding.ui:399
msgid ""
"Look at the camera you selected: an infrared camera shows a small light that "
"blinks while Ubuntu Hello tests it. This tells us whether it can see your "
"face in the dark."
msgstr ""
"Kuckt d'Kamera déi Dir gewielt hutt: eng Infraroutkamera weist e klengt "
"Liicht dat blénkt wärend Ubuntu Hello et testt. Dëst seet eis ob et Äert "
"Gesiicht am Däischteren gesinn kann."

#: src/onboarding.ui:433
msgid "Yes, it flashes"
msgstr "Jo, et blénkt"

#: src/onboarding.ui:459
msgid "No, nothing flashes"
msgstr "Nee, näischt blénkt"

#: src/onboarding.ui:498
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello will search your system automatically for any available "
"cameras, so make sure your webcam is connected. After detection a list of "
"usable webcams will be shown. Pick the one you want to use and click Next."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello sicht Äre System automatesch no verfügbare Kameraen, also "
"vergewëssert Iech datt Är Webcam ugeschloss ass. No der Detektioun gëtt eng "
"Lëscht mat benotzbaren Webcams gewisen. Wielt deen deen Dir benotze wëllt a "
"klickt Next."

#: src/onboarding.ui:517
msgid "Testing your webcams, please wait..."
msgstr "Testt Är Webcams, waart w.e.g. ..."

#: src/onboarding.ui:563
msgid "Downloading data files"
msgstr "Eroflueden Datendateien"

#: src/onboarding.ui:579
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello needs three pre trained facial recognition datasets to be able "
"to recognise you, which will be downloaded now. You can see the download "
"progress below."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello brauch dräi pre-trainéiert Gesiichtserkennungsdatesets fir Iech "
"z'erkennen, déi elo erofgeluede ginn. Dir kënnt den Download Fortschrëtt hei "
"ënnen gesinn."

#: src/onboarding.ui:603
msgid "Starting download..."
msgstr "Start eroflueden ..."

#: src/onboarding.ui:646
msgid "Welcome to Ubuntu Hello!"
msgstr "Wëllkomm op Ubuntu Hello!"

#: src/onboarding.ui:658
msgid "Version"
msgstr "Versioun"

#: src/onboarding.ui:672
msgid ""
"This wizard will walk you through the setup process and automatically "
"configure Ubuntu Hello for you. Press next to continue."
msgstr ""
"Dëse Wizard féiert Iech duerch de Setupprozess an konfiguréiert automatesch "
"Ubuntu Hello fir Iech. Press nächst fir weiderzemaachen."

#: src/onboarding.ui:723
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your login keyring or KWallet using "
"face authentication, preventing password prompts after logging in."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello kann Äre Login-Schlësselring automatesch opspären oder KWallet "
"mat Gesiichtsauthentifikatioun, verhënnert Passwuertprompts nodeems Dir Iech "
"ugemellt hutt."

#: src/onboarding.ui:735
msgid "Enable automatic keyring/KWallet unlocking"
msgstr "Aktivéiert automatesch Schlësselring / KWallet Spär"

#: src/onboarding.ui:763
msgid "Confirm password"
msgstr "Confirméieren Passwuert"

#: src/onboarding.ui:820
msgid "Back"
msgstr "Zréck"

#: src/onboarding.ui:855
msgid "Finish setup"
msgstr "Setup fäerdeg"

#: src/onboarding.ui:882
msgid "Next"
msgstr "Nächst"

#: ubuntu-hello-gtk.desktop.in
msgid "Windows Hello style facial authentication"
msgstr "Windows Hello Stil Gesiichtsauthentifikatioun"

#: ubuntu-hello-gtk.desktop.in
msgid "face;recognition;authentication;security;lock;"
msgstr "Gesiicht; Unerkennung; Authentifikatioun; Sécherheet; Spär;"
